{"3297020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farmsville", "steam_appid": 3297020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Farmsville</strong> — where the magic of nature meets exciting adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/b45d5c2cce1317e7c252a0e840af362d.poster.avif?t=1744145511\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/b45d5c2cce1317e7c252a0e840af362d.webm?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/b45d5c2cce1317e7c252a0e840af362d.mp4?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>• Explore a magical world</strong>. Travel through stunning locations, uncover hidden secrets, and meet unforgettable characters, each with their own unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>• Help and create</strong>. Complete quests for villagers, gather resources, and turn a small plot of land into a thriving farm of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>• Take on challenges</strong>. From simple tasks to epic missions, there’s always something exciting waiting for adventurers like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/ef5cbd76398af0121e3b3cd2a49ebd63.poster.avif?t=1744145511\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/ef5cbd76398af0121e3b3cd2a49ebd63.webm?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/ef5cbd76398af0121e3b3cd2a49ebd63.mp4?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>• Master the art of magic</strong>. Become a guardian of nature, a potion master, or a wielder of elemental powers — the choice is yours. Use your magical abilities to protect your world and enhance your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>• Face daring trials</strong>. Conquer the toughest challenges in the tower and arena to prepare for the ultimate battle against a powerful enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your perfect sanctuary in Farmsville</strong>. Decorate, upgrade, and transform your land into a true paradise. Beyond farming, epic challenges and extraordinary adventures await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/4c2f7a3a511d5ab18c13f120d6a86e39.poster.avif?t=1744145511\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/4c2f7a3a511d5ab18c13f120d6a86e39.webm?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/4c2f7a3a511d5ab18c13f120d6a86e39.mp4?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the adventure now and become part of a magical story!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Farmsville</strong> — where the magic of nature meets exciting adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka