r world and enhance your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>• Face daring trials</strong>. Conquer the toughest challenges in the tower and arena to prepare for the ultimate battle against a powerful enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your perfect sanctuary in Farmsville</strong>. Decorate, upgrade, and transform your land into a true paradise. Beyond farming, epic challenges and extraordinary adventures await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/4c2f7a3a511d5ab18c13f120d6a86e39.poster.avif?t=1744145511\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/4c2f7a3a511d5ab18c13f120d6a86e39.webm?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/extras/4c2f7a3a511d5ab18c13f120d6a86e39.mp4?t=1744145511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the adventure now and become part of a magical story!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to the magical world of farming and adventure! This is a vibrant universe of farming and magic. Grow plants, fight enemies, gain recognition among locals, save the world from the impending threat Can you uncover the secrets of this world?", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Ukrainian, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/header.jpg?t=1744145511", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/5e4f2363b68ef2f40475d4e0e2751183314ae778/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744145511", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297020/5e4f236